}
{
  "The GNSS receiver is turned on and has a two dimensional location (fix) (x,y only), the height cannot be accurately determined. This is normally due to a poor GPS signal, under tree cover or inside a building for example."
  "已开启卫星定位，且获取了二维平面定位（仅x、y坐标），但高度无法准确确定。这通常是因为GPS信号较弱。如处于树荫下或建筑物内等。"
}
{
  "The GNSS receiver is turned on and has a three dimensional location (fix) including height (x,y,z)."
  "已开启卫星定位，且获取了三维立体定位（包括高度，即x、y、z坐标）。"
}
{
  "The GNSS receiver has an error. This could be because Fine Location permission has not been granted for this app."
  "卫星定位存在错误。这可能是因为未授予本应用“精确位置”权限。"
}
{
  "The GNSS receiver is turned on but the signal is not good enough to get a valid location (fix). If this state continues for a long time try turning the device off and then go outside where you have a clear view of the sky. Restart the device and rerun this app, also try selecting the 'AGPS->Clear and update' menu option to download new GPS assistance data."
  "卫星定位已开启，但信号不佳，无法获取有效的定位信息。若此状态持续较长时间，请尝试关闭设备，然后前往视野开阔处重启设备并重新运行此应用，也可尝试选择“AGPS->清除并更新”菜单选项来下载新的GPS辅助数据。"
}
{
  "This device has no internal GNSS receiver installed"
  "此设备未内置卫星定位模块"
}
{
  "The GNSS receiver is turned off. Go to location services to turn the GNSS receiver on."
  "已关闭卫星定位。请转到手机设置-定位服务以打开。"
}
{
  "This app displays information from your device's GPS receiver and other sensors. It shows the position and received signal strength of each satellite within view, as well as your current location and time.\n\nTap on one of the five fields at the bottom (or right in landscape) of each screen to change views.\n\nThe five fields at the top of each screen (or left side in landscape) are buttons and have the following actions, from left to right (or bottom to top in landscape): -\n\nToggle day night mode.\nSave your location.\nStart or stop navigation.\nShare your location.\nDisplay menu.\n\nTapping any other field on a screen displays a settings dialog for that field if it has one."
  "此应用会显示设备的全球导航卫星系统（GNSS）接收器及其他传感器的信息，包括视野内各卫星的位置、接收信号强度，以及当前位置和时间。\n\n点击每个屏幕底部（横屏模式下为右侧）的五个区域之一，可切换视图。\n\n每个屏幕顶部（横屏模式下为左侧）五个按钮，从左到右（横屏模式下为从下到上）的功能如下：\n· 切换日夜模式\n· 保存位置\n· 开始或停止导航\n· 分享位置\n· 显示菜单\n \n点击屏幕上的其他任何区域，若该区域有设置项，会显示其设置对话框。"
}
{
  "This view displays satellite signal information. The GPS Status field shows the state of the GPS receiver. You can tap on this field to display a help dialog, showing the current state of the GPS signal. This dialog has a location services button to turn the GPS on or off. GPS Status can have one of the following values: -\n\nGPS Error Error with GPS could be permissions.\nGPS None Your device has no GPS.\nGPS Off The GPS is turned off.\nNo Fix The GPS has no location fix.\n2D Fix The GPS has a partial location fix.\n3D Fix The GPS has a full location fix.\n\nThe Accuracy field shows the accuracy of the GPS location, the smaller the number the better.\n\nBelow this field is the satellite signal graph, it shows a bar for each satellite in view. The number beneath the bar is the satellite number (if the number colours are inverted the satellite is used in calculating the positional fix) and the number above it is the signal to noise ratio in decibels. you can horizontally scroll the graph to show more satellites.In the top corners of the graph are two fields showing how many satellites the GPS can see and how many are being used to calculate your position.\n\nBelow the satellite signal graph is a legend for the SNR colour. The colours represent signal to noise ratio ranges. The satellite signals can have an SNR value between 0 and 99dB, 0 is worst. Normally the SNR will never get above 50 and anything above 40 is really good.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nLocation Services Show the location services screen to turn the GPS on or off.\nAGPS->Clear only Clears AGPS aiding data from your phone, do this if your GPS takes a long time to get a fix.\nAGPS->Update only Request the download of AGPS aiding data. The AGPS aiding data can become out of date, so requesting an update will get the latest version.\nAGPS->Clear and update Request AGPS clear and update at the same time.\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此视图显示卫星信号信息。“GPS状态”字段显示GPS接收器的状态。点击该字段可显示帮助对话框，其中会展示GPS信号的当前状态。该对话框包含一个位置服务按钮，用于开启或关闭GPS。GPS状态可能有以下几种：\n· 错误：GPS存在错误，可能是权限问题。\n无：设备没有GPS。\n· 已关闭：GPS已被设为关闭。\n· 无定位：GPS未获取到当前定位信息。\n· 平面定位：GPS获取到部分定位信息，仅支持经纬度定位。\n· 立体定位：GPS获取到完整定位信息。\n \n“精度”字段显示GPS定位的精度，数值越小越好。\n \n该字段下方是卫星信号图表，图表中每个卫星对应一根柱状条。柱状条下方的数字是卫星编号（如果数字颜色反转，则表示该卫星参与了位置计算），上方的数字是信噪比（单位为分贝）。可水平滚动图表以显示更多卫星。图表的左上角和右上角各有一个字段，分别显示可探测到的卫星数量和用于位置计算的卫星数量。\n \n卫星信号图表下方是信噪比颜色的图例。不同颜色代表不同的信噪比范围。卫星信号的信噪比值在0到99分贝之间，0表示最差。通常信噪比不会超过50，超过40就已经非常好。\n \n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 位置服务：显示位置服务屏幕，用于开启或关闭GPS。\n· AGPS->仅清除：清除手机中的AGPS辅助数据，若GPS定位耗时过长，可执行此操作。\n· AGPS->仅更新：请求下载AGPS辅助数据。AGPS辅助数据可能会过期，因此请求更新可获取最新版本。\n· AGPS->清除并更新：同时请求清除和更新AGPS数据。\n· 分享：与他人分享你的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This view displays satellite positions. The large circular field on this screen shows a view of the sky overhead (sky view), the outside of the circle represents the horizon and the centre represents the sky directly above your head. The sky view rotates to the correct position using the internal compass. The satellites in view of the GPS receiver are drawn on the sky view if the symbol is round the satellite is a GPS satellite and if the symbol is a triangle the satellite is a GLONASS satellite. Each satellite symbol has the satellite number shown below it and is drawn in a colour that represents the satellite signal to noise ratio. The signal to noise ratios and corresponding colour ranges are shown on the SNR legend, below the sky view.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nLocation Services Show the location services screen to turn the GPS on or off.\nAGPS->Clear Clear AGPS aiding data from your phone, do this if your GPS takes a long time to get a fix.\nAGPS->Update Request the download of AGPS aiding data. The AGPS aiding data can become out of date, so requesting an update will get the latest version.\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此视图显示卫星位置。屏幕上的大型圆形区域显示头顶的天空视图，圆圈外围代表地平线，中心代表头顶正上方的天空。天空视图会通过内置指南针旋转至正确位置。可观测到的卫星会绘制在天空视图上：如圆形符号表示GPS卫星，三角形符号表示GLONASS卫星。每个卫星符号下方标有卫星编号，其颜色代表卫星的信噪比。信噪比及对应的颜色范围显示在天空视图下方的信噪比图例中。\n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 位置服务：显示位置服务屏幕，用于开启或关闭GPS。\n· AGPS->清除：清除手机中的AGPS辅助数据，若GPS定位耗时过长，可执行此操作。\n· AGPS->更新：请求下载AGPS辅助数据。AGPS辅助数据可能会过期，因此请求更新可获取最新版本。\n· 分享：与他人分享你的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This view displays your position on the earth. The top field shows the coordinates of your current location in the selected coordinate grid. The bottom field is a map of the world, on which your current position is shown by a red marker. The transition between day and night and the location of the sun relative to your current location is also drawn on the map.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此视图显示您在地球上的位置。上方字段显示当前位置在所选坐标系中的坐标。下方是世界地图，地图上用红色标记标示您的当前位置。地图上还绘制了晨昏线以及太阳相对于您当前位置的方位。\n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 分享：与他人分享您的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This view displays a compass when not in navigation mode.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nScreen editor Switch to screen editor mode to change the compass type.\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "非导航模式下，此视图会显示指南针。\n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 屏幕编辑器：切换至屏幕编辑器模式，以更改指南针类型。\n· 分享：与他人分享您的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "GPS Test Plus supports simple navigation. You can save your current location or enter a new location and then navigate to it. The top two fields and the compass field are customisable.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nScreen editor Switch to screen editor mode to change the screen field types.\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "GPS Test Plus支持简单导航。您可以保存当前位置或输入新位置，然后导航至该位置。顶部两个字段和指南针字段可自定义。 \n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 屏幕编辑器：切换至屏幕编辑器模式，以更改指南针类型。\n· 分享：与他人分享您的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This view displays a number of customisable fields and widgets.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nScreen editor Switch to screen editor mode to change the screen field types and layout.\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此视图显示多个可自定义的字段和小组件。\n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 屏幕编辑器：切换至屏幕编辑器模式，以更改指南针类型。\n· 分享：与他人分享您的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This view displays various time and date fields. The top two fields show the time and date from your GPS receiver in GPS Time. This is based on international atomic time and is the same throughout the world. The next two fields show the time and date local to your current location. The next two fields show the sunrise and sunset times at your current location. The last two fields show the moon phase at you location and a daylight clock.\n\nThis view has these menu options: -\n\nShare Share your location with other people.\nSettings Display the general settings dialog.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此视图显示各种时间和日期字段。顶部两个字段显示来自GPS接收器的GPS时间及日期，该时间基于国际原子时，全球统一。接下来的两个字段显示当前位置的本地时间和日期。再下面的两个字段显示当前位置的日出和日落时间。最后两个字段显示当前位置的月相和日照时钟。\n\n此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 分享：与他人分享您的位置。\n· 设置：显示通用设置对话框。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
{
  "This screen displays a list of your saved locations. Tapping a list item displays the location details screen. Press and hold a list item to select it, the item's icon is replaced with a tick. When items are selected the toolbar changes and if only one item is selected you can edit, delete, share or export the item. If more than one item is selected you can only delete, share or export them.\n\nThis view has these menu options when no items are selected: -\n\nDelete locations Delete all saved locations in the database.\nExport->to GPX files Export saved locations to a file in GPX format.\nExport->to KML files Export saved locations to a file in KML format.\nHelp Display this help screen."
  "此屏幕显示已保存位置的列表。点击列表项会显示位置详情屏幕。长按列表项可选中该项目，项目图标会替换为勾选标记。选中项目后，工具栏会发生变化：若仅选中一个项目，可对其进行编辑、删除、分享或导出操作；若选中多个项目，则只能进行删除、分享或导出操作。\n\n未选中任何项目时，此视图包含以下菜单选项：\n· 删除位置：删除数据库中所有已保存的位置。\n· 导出->至GPX文件：将已保存的位置导出为GPX格式的文件。\n· 导出->至KML文件：将已保存的位置导出为KML格式的文件。\n· 帮助：显示本帮助屏幕。"
}
